  "prefLabel": "Rev 901.10 Earnings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 901.10 “Earnings” means the excess income received by an organization after the payment of its expenses.\n\nSource. #4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; renumbered by #9658 (from Rev 901.08); renumbered by #9843 (from Rev 901.09) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 900); ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12 (from Rev 901.08); renumbered by #10795 (from Rev 901.09); ss by #13433, eff 8-12-22",
